(1, 'abc-cbd.fr', 'first', 'ussp@us.com', 'hssiksdfsdf'),
(2, 'abc-cbd.fr', 'new message', 'ussp@usp.com', 'test is new message'),
(3, 'clamamagazine.com', 'Test', 'azerty23@yopmail.com', 'This is a test. \r\nBlaBlaBla\r\n\r\nsqfsfdfds'),
(4, 'clamamagazine.com', 'Test2', 'azerty08011874@yopmail.com', 'sfsdfsdf\r\nTest2'),
(5, 'clamamagazine.com', 'Chan', 'sharon.mkt@outlook.com', 'Hi\r\n\r\nHow are you?\r\nCan we talk about the important facts of your website design and marketing?\r\n\r\nMay I have your phone number & the best time to connect?'),
(6, 'clamamagazine.com', 'Belton', 'brianna@biggerbetterprofits.com', 'Hi,\r\n\r\nDoes your business need reliable, accurate, and affordable bookkeeping and accounting services?\r\n\r\nWe are a US based bookkeeping/accounting firm that specializes in helping SMBs manage their financial reporting and maximize profits.\r\n\r\nIf interested, kindly provide me your name, phone number, and email.\r\n\r\nTo your success,\r\nBrianna Belton'),
(7, 'clamamagazine.com', 'Chen M', 'eichel.rocco@gmail.com', 'Hey, I visited your site and I think that your content is amazing! It is really engaging and original, you must have worked so hard to generate such a quality content.\r\n\r\nMy name is Chen from ForeMedia and I help website owners with great websites to maximize the revenue they make from their website.\r\n\r\nI would love to buy Ad Spaces on your website and pay you per each impression of the ads on your site. We are Google Ad Exchange Premium partners and we work with more than 100 Ad Network & thousands of premium direct advertisers who would LOVE to buy Ads directly from your site and we can gurantee to increase your revenue by at least 45% compared to other advertising solutions you are currently using.\r\n\r\nYou deserve to earn more for your content and maximize your earning potential and I will help you unlock that potential!\r\n\r\nThere is no cost, you can register to our monetization platform for free on this link: https://bit.ly/3mxR3T7\r\n\r\nI will be available for you on the Live Chat if you need any help\r\n\r\nI have at least 17 Premium Advertisers that have asked me to approach you because they would like to advertise on your website on Premium eCPM [cost per impressions] basis.\r\n\r\nHave a good day & feel free to ping me for any question!\r\n\r\nClick the link here for 1 minute registration to our platform [it\'s free!]: https://bit.ly/3mxR3T7'),
(8, 'cbd-mania.fr', 'Michelet', 'prestataire@unplanfacile.com', 'Bonjour,\r\nJe vous écris pour vous informer que j\'ai remarqué certaines failles sur votre site internet. Il s\'agit notamment d\'images lourdes et mal redimensionnées ainsi que d\'une mauvaise structure SEO (referencement naturel).\r\nSpécialisé depuis 14 ans dans l\'audit de sites internet et je suis convaincu que je peux vous aider à améliorer ces problèmes. Mon diagnostique complet vous permettra d\'avoir un site plus rapide et mieux référencé.\r\nEn plus de cela, nous disposons de comptes Google certifiés pour publier des commentaires positifs sur votre fiche Google Business en toute discrétion. Nous signalerons également les avis négatifs conformément aux règles de Google sur le contenu, pour tenter de les faire supprimer.\r\nN\'hésitez pas à jeter un coup d\'oeil sur notre site www.unplanfacile.com pour en savoir plus sur les services que nous proposons. Je souhaite vous offrir une réduction de 50% sur notre service d\'audit avec le code promo MAI2023. \r\nJe suis disponible dans un premier temps par mail pour discuter de votre projet à tout moment. Merci de votre attention et j\'espère avoir bientôt de vos nouvelles.\r\n\r\nCordialement,\r\n\r\nMarc Michelet\r\nwww.unplanfacile.com');

